{{> head officeStyles=true}}<body class="office">{{> staffNav}}<main id="main" class="office-main"><header class="page-heading"><div><h1>API documentation</h1><p>Internal interfaces share the same database, session and role permissions as office screens.</p></div></header><section class="panel"><h2>Authentication and access</h2><p>Sign in through <code>/login</code>. Send the <code>smartcivi.sid</code> session cookie with requests. Mutations also require <code>X-CSRF-Token</code>, available from the signed-in page’s <code>csrf-token</code> meta tag. Sessions expire after 30 minutes of inactivity.</p><p>Registry officers can access residents, registry and requests. Resource officers can access resources. Administrators can access all datasets. Citizens cannot use office APIs.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table class="office-table"><thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Purpose</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>GET</td><td>/api/v1/summary</td><td>Role-scoped live counts</td></tr><tr><td>GET</td><td>/api/v1/residents<br>/api/v1/registry<br>/api/v1/resources</td><td>Paginated records: q, page and archived=1 (25 per page)</td></tr><tr><td>POST</td><td>/api/v1/residents<br>/api/v1/registry<br>/api/v1/resources</td><td>Create a record using the corresponding office form’s field names</td></tr><tr><td>POST</td><td>/api/v1/{dataset}/{id}</td><td>Update a record; resource quantities use movements</td></tr><tr><td>POST</td><td>/api/v1/resources/{id}/move</td><td>action, quantity; recipient for allocate, allocationId for return</td></tr><tr><td>GET</td><td>/api/v1/registry-soap?wsdl</td><td>WSDL for the narrow LookupRecord contract</td></tr><tr><td>POST</td><td>/api/v1/registry-soap</td><td>SOAP lookup by registry number; same session and CSRF header required</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>SOAP request</h3><pre>&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/"&gt;
  &lt;soap:Body&gt;
    &lt;LookupRecord xmlns="urn:smartcivi"&gt;
      &lt;registryNumber&gt;REG-2026-001&lt;/registryNumber&gt;
    &lt;/LookupRecord&gt;
  &lt;/soap:Body&gt;
&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;</pre><p>Responses include record type and event date. Personal names are excluded. External service accounts, cross-agency exchange, identity-provider SSO and national identifier verification are not configured.</p></section></main>{{> officeFooter}}</body></html>
